    "sub_ename": "CONSUMER BEHAVIOR",
    "describe_ch": "The course familiarizes students with current relevant issues of consumer behavior. Information and theoretical models of consumer behavior at the personal and organizational level will be introduced, with focus on the process of decision making. This includes purpose of purchase, the type of products and services they buy, the channel of their purchase, and the frequency of purchase.",
